From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChatGPT <patches@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH v10] hydrogenx: audited clean-tree governor and boost stack for pissarro

This v10 replaces the oversized v7/v8/v9 atlas patches with a useful-only
clean-tree patch. It keeps the kernel-side changes that have an execution path
in the booted kernel and removes the giant offline CSV/profile ballast.

Kept: HydrogenX cpufreq governor, /sys/kernel/hydrogenx boost controller,
input/frame scene boosts, existing MediaTek tune_plus SchedTune/UCLAMP bridge,
pissarro defconfig defaults, zram LZ4 default, f2fs/erofs/zram/lz4/zstd/bbr
configuration, and compact verification scripts.

Removed: giant CSV/profile atlases and oversized documentation. LZ4K/LZ4KD/
OPLUS entries, if present in this patch, are compatibility Kconfig aliases to
stock LZ4 only; they are not a real codec implementation.

---
